{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50185","headline":"谒河上公庙（伯三六一九） · 祖咏","name":"谒河上公庙（伯三六一九）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河上公遗迹，迹凉在道边。\n草生空庙里，□□□□□。\n□□□知圣，腾空更表仙。\n孝文皇帝後，《章句》至今传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"祖咏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}